STATEMENT: >>>
The scribe command's own help epilogue still argues from INVARIANT, a node type
retired by the 2026-08-30 migration, and its sentence about which types carry
DEPTH has been garbled by successive edits. The text is generated prose around
a grammar-derived surface, so it drifted without any check noticing.
